WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.864
There is more than one way to help Cannabis grow. Developers

00:00:06.864 --> 00:00:13.728
can review code. Creators can share original artwork. Curious people can

00:00:13.728 --> 00:00:15.600
ask good questions.

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:20.784
Start with the official project website and GitHub repository. Read the

00:00:20.784 --> 00:00:24.780
published rules, follow release updates, and join the discussion.

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:30.360
When enrollment opens, use the verified instructions and your own wallet.

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:35.640
Keep your recovery secrets private. Your next step today: explore, contribute,

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:37.080
and stay connected.
